 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GKH6OhEcKRwQ7kNvwEE4UMt&_nc_oc=AdpvnZgw4g32C_Mp6FZ6LBMU1Jl5Tb23xN2VTpDKsgXGo_rmRoYeH4OpxgmroCUqiBI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPXo1amrdtL-rkGEBaqgqgJShQpHbLbm_JnZobpqMS_DQ&oe=6AC905C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KvwF9nhSnS0Q7kNvwGZYkl5&_nc_oc=AdrN4AyS_qyV5126gKz8aZXpZruULTHltxP_Ri1OubC3TdwFrcpg4anyVB2jB_wfmEQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMPefSs6dHAQabrHzhZtXqgAlbmMTjMGMKOyy9-J1JvcQ&oe=6AC91326"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d2m21T17pbwQ7kNvwGOBnhw&_nc_oc=Adre3bmUJtmo_JlJqudDwaagS0zGr3aMx608Wo1jORFMJkvN0NmkoPNJ-2v_Ny08opI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNtOwwe_IwTwWkeGRk_bvyPo_t36IVWTje2YVKZb9qqZQ&oe=6AC8E4DC"}, {"fil